  "_calibration": "Every range here is EXACTLY the range real top-50 players occupy, measured with --calibrate on 2026-09-11. It is deliberately not widened. A first draft widened each range by one item either side and all 48 tests passed on the first run, which makes a regression suite that cannot detect a regression. Strict conformance to what humans hold is a claim the optimizer can fail, and a failure here is information rather than noise -- sometimes about the optimizer, sometimes about a range that a patch moved. Re-run --calibrate after a patch before trusting a new failure.",
  "_objectives": "From data/build_objectives.json. A champion with no entry here uses fight_engine.default_objective(), which reads its class. An entry is only present where the TEST's intent differs from that default."
